Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.58,0:00:53.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,So tell me. How was Hawaii?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.19,0:00:57.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- It was unbelievable. - Oh, yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.42,0:00:59.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- Well, what happened? - I met this guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.13,0:01:02.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,It was the best week of my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.89,0:01:05.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,It was just a little vacation romance.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.93,0:01:07.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,But he was so sweet.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.97,0:01:10.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,He took me to all these cool local places.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.47,0:01:12.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,We went scuba diving...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.94,0:01:15.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- Snorkeling. - Mountain climbing.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.07,0:01:18.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,We went cliff diving.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.74,0:01:22.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Well, we got a little drunk.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.78,0:01:24.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- He gave me... - A back rub.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.82,0:01:26.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,We slow danced...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.28,0:01:27.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- in the rain.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.85,0:01:29.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,But it wasn't just about the sex.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.39,0:01:33.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,He pounded me like a mallard duck.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.66,0:01:36.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,It ended kind of weird, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.76,0:01:39.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,When I asked for his number, he said he's...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.20,0:01:40.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- Married. - Gay.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.63,0:01:43.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- Entering the priesthood. - He doesn't believe in phones.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.47,0:01:46.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,He just kind of ran away.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.04,0:01:49.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,You know, it was just a little fling, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.71,0:01:51.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,I won't forget my week...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.38,0:01:52.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- with Henry Roth.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.94,0:01:55.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- Henry Roth. - Harry.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.81,0:01:58.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Harry Paratesticles.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.55,0:02:00.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- Henry Roth. - Henry Roth.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.79,0:02:02.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- Henry Roth. - Henry Roth.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.15,0:02:06.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Henry Roth, why didn't you tell me you were a secret agent?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.56,0:02:11.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,I prefer intelligence operative, and I couldn't tell you until I knew you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.40,0:02:13.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Well, can I call you when I land?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.53,0:02:17.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,You can call me, but I' II be in Peru. I said that a little loud.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.27,0:02:21.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Come on, that's a 187, code blue. We got the wolf sleeping at night.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.41,0:02:25.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,He's slipping his arm in the drawer and out comes the cookie jar. All clear.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.65,0:02:27.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Got it?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.71,0:02:31.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Well, maybe when you get back from Peru.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.68,0:02:34.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- I don't think that's an option, Lisa. - Linda.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.89,0:02:38.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,I know. I changed your name for your protection.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.66,0:02:42.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,We have to go our separate ways now.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.66,0:02:45.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Well, goodbye.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.33,0:02:47.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Got it! Moving out!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.07,0:02:55.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- What the hell is your problem? - Just keep going, I' II give you $20.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.17,0:02:59.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- You got it. How's your balls? - Killing me. Hit it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.73,0:03:16.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Easy, Honah Lee.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.23,0:03:19.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, I' m a person, not a seal
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.00,0:03:25.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Well, I am a vet, not a doctor. So just hold still, or I won't give you a treat.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.67,0:03:27.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,I know, it's okay. You see that, kids?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.71,0:03:30.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,You see what happens when you play with sharks?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.91,0:03:34.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Now, why you gotta spread those lies? Sharks are like dogs.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.58,0:03:37.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,They only bite when you touch their private parts.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.55,0:03:40.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,That's a good title for my documentary.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.72,0:03:44.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Sharks: They Only Bite When You Touch Their Private Parts.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.96,0:03:48.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Or you could call it, Sharks: They Tried to Eat My Kidney.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.73,0:03:52.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,All right, enough already. You too, Willie.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.83,0:03:56.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,All of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.84,0:03:58.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,He just cast a spell on us.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.64,0:04:02.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,All right. Put this on four times a day for two weeks.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.71,0:04:05.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- You can handle that. - What's wrong with that turtle?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.78,0:04:08.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Lung problems because he smoked too much turtle weed...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.75,0:04:10.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,...which is bad for you. Right, Ula?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.98,0:04:13.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,What? I don't smoke weed.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.05,0:04:18.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, Honah Lee? How's that hot wahine nympho from Ohio?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.62,0:04:21.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Great. I dropped her off at the airport this morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.49,0:04:23.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Come on, I need some details.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.19,0:04:26.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,You get some booby, some assy, a pull on your poi-poi? Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.53,0:04:28.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Daddy, what's a nympho?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.20,0:04:32.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Oh. The nympho is the state bird of Ohio.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.17,0:04:36.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,You're the state idiot of Hawaii.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.01,0:04:40.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Here you go. Bite the fish, chew the fish, love the fish. Enjoy.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.48,0:04:43.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- You crack me up, kamaaina. - Oh, yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.45,0:04:44.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- One of these days... - Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.02,0:04:47.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,...you'll show one of those tourists such a good time...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.99,0:04:49.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,...she'll wanna stay on the island.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.95,0:04:51.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Why do you say mean things like that...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.06,0:04:54.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,...and why is your foot on my pillow?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.73,0:04:58.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,I don't want your ass on it, either. Get up! Get up!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.03,0:05:00.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,It could happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.83,0:05:03.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Then you won't be able to go on your boat trip to Alaska.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.34,0:05:10.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,You'll be stuck here, waking up next to the same old, ugly broad, just like Ula.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.45,0:05:18.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- Just kidding, guys. - About the old part or the ugly part?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.65,0:05:23.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Henry, come quickly! It's Jocko!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.96,0:05:32.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Jocko! What's going on with you, buddy?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.90,0:05:35.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Don't be scared. Everything's gonna be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.93,0:05:38.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Just stay calm. All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.47,0:05:42.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Willie, I don't need you to see this. Get out of here, now!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.74,0:05:45.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Okay, check the temperature of the pool Go! Hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.65,0:05:50.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,What are you doing? I meant check the thermometer!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.38,0:05:52.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Give me a hand. Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.62,0:05:54.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Get me two fish from the barrel Now.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.05,0:05:56.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- Okay. - Just hang in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.55,0:05:58.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- Here. - It 's gonna be all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.66,0:06:01.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,That's a little warm. Go to the bottom of the barrel, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.77,0:06:10.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Okay, there. That's good. Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.14,0:06:12.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Come on, buddy, take it. Take it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.04,0:06:15.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- He's not responding! - I know, Alexa!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.21,0:06:18.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry, I smacked you. You needed the fish-slap to calm down.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.41,0:06:21.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- Do you understand? Are you calm? - Yes. Fish-slap calm me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.55,0:06:23.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,I'm gonna try to get him breathing manually...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.12,0:06:27.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,...so I need your face next to his mouth to see if it's working.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.49,0:06:28.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- Are you ready? - Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.09,0:06:31.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- One, two, three! - Nothing, nothing!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.62,0:06:36.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,All right! Try it again. If it doesn't work we'll perform a tracheotomy.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.23,0:06:39.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,We don't wanna do that, so let's pray this works. One more time.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.60,0:06:41.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,One, two...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.14,0:06:53.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,That's a lot of vomit.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.41,0:06:56.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,This is why I got into this business.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.92,0:06:59.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,To save sea animals.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.18,0:07:01.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,You should go wash yourself off, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.02,0:07:05.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Maybe try some turpentine. That might take the stink away.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.06,0:07:09.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, high-five is right, buddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.19,0:07:12.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,I knew you were gonna burp, but the vomit thing was awesome!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.16,0:07:16.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,That's what she gets for eating my roast beef sandwich.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.04,0:07:18.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Willie, did you see that?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.96,0:07:42.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Captain's log: November 5th, 6:45 a.m.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.36,0:07:45.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,I've taken the Sea Serpent for a trip around the island of Oahu.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.83,0:07:48.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,It is by far the longest voyage she has yet underaken...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.90,0:07:51.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,...and its completion will signal that she's ready...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.74,0:07:53.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,...for our great journey to Bristol Bay...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.01,0:07:57.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,...whose unspoiled walus habitat will yield an abundance of...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.32,0:08:07.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.69,0:08:09.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Are you kidding me?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.14,0:08:31.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Aloha, honey. What can I get for you?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.61,0:08:34.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,I guess I' II take a cup of coffee.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.38,0:08:36.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- You guess? - Yeah, I already ate breakfast.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.08,0:08:40.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,I need to kill some time before the Coast Guard gets here to tow my boat.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.95,0:08:42.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,What did you eat?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.39,0:08:46.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,I had a Reese's Peanut Butter Cup and some Gatorade.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.22,0:08:49.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,They're not breakfast. I get you Spam and eggs.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.43,0:08:51.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Nick, I need Spam and eggs.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.43,0:08:54.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.47,0:08:57.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- You like the peanut butter cups? - Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.90,0:09:00.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Want me to put peanut butter cups in your eggs?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.41,0:09:02.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,No, that's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.84,0:09:05.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Peanut butter cups.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.53,0:09:26.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- Hey, Sue, nice haircut. - Mahalo, Lucy.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.80,0:10:00.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Are you staring at me or her?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.70,0:10:02.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Because you're starting to freak me out.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.43,0:10:06.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Settle down and eat your pancakes.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.88,0:10:13.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,I think she's a local girl I wanted to go up to her...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.81,0:10:17.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,...but I was kind of off my game. But, man, was she cute, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.25,0:10:19.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,I thought you liked your bitches from out of state.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.22,0:10:23.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, that's usually my policy. Make sure I don't get tied down.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.16,0:10:26.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Freeze that image right there.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.82,0:10:30.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,There's the little fella. Congratulations, Mommy.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.96,0:10:35.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Sounds to me like someone is afraid of commitment.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.37,0:10:36.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Let me guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.10,0:10:39.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Your high school sweetheart got drunk at party...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.74,0:10:42.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,...then cheated on you with whole wrestling team.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.04,0:10:46.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Close. Actually, it was my college girlfriend Tracy.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.41,0:10:49.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,And it wasn't a wrestling team. It was her academic advisor.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.61,0:10:53.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- Oh, she liked the older man. - Older women. About 50 years older.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.82,0:10:55.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,I hope you shot the stupid tramp.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.15,0:10:58.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,What's with the "tramp" and the "bitches" talk?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.69,0:11:02.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- Are you drunk or something? - I apologize for nasty talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.46,0:11:05.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,I am grouchy due to lack of recent physical intimacy.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.53,0:11:09.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Shut up, because here comes one-time-only opportunity.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.07,0:11:13.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,What I will do now is go into your office and become naked.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.11,0:11:17.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Next move is up to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.78,0:11:21.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,I may not be as limber as I once was...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.35,0:11:26.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,...but I make up for it with enthusiasm and willingness to experiment.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.92,0:11:30.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,I don't know if you realize, I'm not into guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.48,0:11:52.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, Mr. Peanut Butter Cups.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.74,0:11:55.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, Mr. Could -Kill -Me-in-One-Punch. How you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.55,0:11:58.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- You're back. - Couldn't get enough of that Spam.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.38,0:12:00.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Fry some up and throw some eggs on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.65,0:12:02.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- You got it. - All right, mahalo.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.39,0:12:05.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- Hi, Lucy. - Hi, Nick.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.77,0:12:21.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,You know, why don't you try this?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.58,0:12:27.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,It's kind of a hinge.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.58,0:12:33.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- Now, why didn't I think of that? - Well, you're too close to the project.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.45,0:12:34.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Don't be hard on yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.25,0:12:38.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Right. Sometimes you need an outsider's perspective.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.19,0:12:39.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Fresh eye never hurts.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.09,0:12:43.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,I'm Lucy.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.53,0:12:44.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Yes. I' m Henry Roth.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.13,0:12:46.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- Nice to meet you. - Nice to meet you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.13,0:12:50.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,It's pretty. Keep up the good work.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.37,0:12:55.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Wait. I see you're sitting there alone. Do you wanna come and sit down?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.27,0:13:00.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- Sure, that'd be great, if that's all right. - Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.51,0:13:07.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- So are you an architect? - I am not. I' m in fish.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.55,0:13:09.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, that's where the smell is coming from.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.95,0:13:12.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, yeah, I was feeding a walrus this morning...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.79,0:13:16.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,...and I thought I got most of it off of me, but guess I didn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.03,0:13:19.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- I love that smell. - No, you don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.63,0:13:22.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- Fish don't even like that smell. - No, I do. My dad's a fisherman.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.37,0:13:27.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,He and my brother Doug, they go out to sea for months at a time.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.47,0:13:31.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,And I miss them so much while they're gone that when they come back...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.18,0:13:35.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,...I just hold on to them for five minutes each.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.88,0:13:43.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,And they smell just like your hands. It's the best smell in the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.85,0:13:45.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Well, my fingers are available...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.82,0:13:48.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,...for your sniffing pleasure anytime you need them.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.46,0:13:51.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- Wanna? - Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.04,0:14:03.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Sea lions are known for their athleticism...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.11,0:14:06.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,...and dolphins are known for their intelligence.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.11,0:14:11.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- Walruses are known for their... - Tusks?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.38,0:14:17.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Their tusks. Also their male parts can get pretty gigantic.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.12,0:14:21.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, yeah, it's the second biggest out of all the mammals.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.56,0:14:26.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- What's the first? - I think Tattoo-Face.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.43,0:14:32.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Ilike your laugh.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.74,0:14:34.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Ilike you making me laugh.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.44,0:14:37.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,I hate to break this up, but we're setting up for lunch.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.61,0:14:40.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, okay. Sorry, Sue.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.11,0:14:44.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,And the real cool thing about walruses is they're very mysterious.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.65,0:14:46.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- Mysterious? - Yeah, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.05,0:14:49.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,We don't really know what they're like in the wild.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.99,0:14:53.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Don't they just sleep on icebergs and yawn all the time?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.39,0:14:56.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,All we really see is what they do outside of the water...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.43,0:14:58.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,...but who knows what they do under the ice...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.13,0:15:01.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,...where they spend two-thirds of their lives.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.60,0:15:06.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Well, maybe they're intimidating the other creatures with their big winkies.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.47,0:15:08.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,That is one theory.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.01,0:15:12.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- I have to go. - Where you going?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.51,0:15:16.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,It's my dad's birthday, and we go every year and we pick a pineapple.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.38,0:15:20.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- It 's a tradition. - That sounds nice. Okay, well...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.32,0:15:21.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,...I had a great time.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.99,0:15:24.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- Me too. - Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.66,0:15:28.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Would you like to have breakfast again tomorrow morning, same time?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.63,0:15:31.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- Because I teach an art class at 10. - Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.20,0:15:32.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- Yeah. - I wish I could make it...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.96,0:15:34.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,...but, yes, I will be there.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.77,0:15:38.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- Take care. - Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.60,0:15:41.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- One for the road. It is fishy. - Got you good.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.94,0:15:43.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- Aloha. - Aloha!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.51,0:15:45.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,See you tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.61,0:15:48.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.71,0:15:51.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, my goodness.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.03,0:16:03.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.50,0:16:06.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,I had a bee on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.80,0:16:09.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- All right. - He was a big one.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.47,0:16:16.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Which means "look at those two shitheads."
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.55,0:16:26.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,That was the stupidest-looking swing I' ve ever seen.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.52,0:16:28.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,I'm gonna take a Molokai on that one.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.02,0:16:31.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,No throwing. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.66,0:16:34.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Stop laughing, you hyenas. Let's see what you get.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.49,0:16:36.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Okay, you heard me. Go! Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.99,0:16:38.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Show papa what you got.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.57,0:16:53.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- You suck, you're good at everything. - Father of the Year strikes again.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.81,0:16:58.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,By the way, cuz, I met this sexy, blond tax attorney at Starbucks today.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.12,0:17:03.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,I told her you the kahuna she wanna have fun on this island.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.55,0:17:05.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,You want her number?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.49,0:17:07.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,You pimping tourists for me again?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.39,0:17:10.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Yes! I live vicariously through you, remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.23,0:17:11.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,My life sucks.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.66,0:17:14.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Now, come on. Give her the Waikikiki sneaky between the cheeky.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.93,0:17:20.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Ula needs it. I imagine I did it and then I can get through another weekend.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.54,0:17:22.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,I'm staying in. Sorry. Thank you, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.97,0:17:24.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- What? - Hey, Dad!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.88,0:17:26.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Not now, Keanu Mokokokakau.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.04,0:17:28.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,But your stitches are bleeding.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.22,0:17:32.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,It must've been my huge back-swing.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.15,0:17:36.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,You think you can stitch me up after I get back from surfing?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.45,0:17:39.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- Yeah, looking forward to it. - I wouldn't surf with a wound like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.16,0:17:41.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,You might attract a shark.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.69,0:17:44.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,What's wrong with that? Sharks are naturally peaceful
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.56,0:17:47.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Is that right? How'd you get that nasty cut, anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.73,0:17:49.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,A shark bit me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.37,0:17:50.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.14,0:17:53.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Go smoke another one, bro.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.34,0:17:55.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,That shark theory's starting to catch on.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.71,0:17:57.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Now, will everybody keep it down...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.64,0:18:00.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,...while I whack the crap out of this thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.82,0:18:07.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Sit! Stay! Shit! No!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.36,0:18:15.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Where the hell is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.83,0:18:18.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Looking for something?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.37,0:18:27.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, my God! What are you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.04,0:18:31.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,The same thing you are. Looking for my ball.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.94,0:18:35.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,This is weird. I' ve been thinking about you all morning, all day.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.05,0:18:38.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Can't wait to have breakfast with you again.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.42,0:18:41.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,I know. And I just wanna eat you up.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.55,0:18:44.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- Really? - Yeah. Tomorrow and the next day...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.16,0:18:48.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,...and the next day and the next day. - All right. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.96,0:18:50.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, my.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.69,0:18:53.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, Lucy, that feels so good.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.13,0:18:58.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,No, my nipples are too sensitive. Stop that.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.24,0:19:05.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- What happened? - Your ball hooked into that cart...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.94,0:19:09.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,...bounced back and hit you in the head. It was freaking hilarious.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.95,0:19:11.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- What? - Who's Lucy?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.62,0:19:14.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,And what's up with your nipples?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.09,0:19:19.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,I can't be falling for a local I ain't ever going back to that diner.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.12,0:19:22.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- This where you got hit? - Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.87,0:19:32.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,You're so lucky you're a professional cliff diver in Hawaii.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.50,0:19:34.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- Yeah, well, it's a living. - I' m a tax attorney.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.17,0:19:37.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- We never get to have any fun. - Is that right?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.04,0:19:43.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,I'd like to do something extra fun tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.99,0:19:54.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Taking it deep, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.93,0:20:02.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,How about another fishbowl for the lady?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.20,0:20:05.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- Why don't I just tap a keg for her? - Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.94,0:20:08.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,I think I' m getting kind of drunk.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.64,0:20:11.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- Are you getting drunk? - Getting there.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.51,0:20:14.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,So, what are you thinking?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.35,0:20:20.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,What am I thinking?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.89,0:20:27.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Actually, I' m not drunk at all, Noreen, and neither are you...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.39,0:20:30.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,...because there's no alcohol in these drinks.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.06,0:20:33.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Sadly, I' ve used this technique many times.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.73,0:20:36.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,It helps lovely tourists, such as yourself...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.17,0:20:39.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,...loosen up without impairing your ability to stay awake...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.47,0:20:42.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,...and have guilt -free, vigorous sex with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.71,0:20:45.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- Wow. - I' m sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.44,0:20:49.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,I'm not a cliff diver, either. I'm afraid of heights.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.35,0:20:52.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Well, since it's my last night in town...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.52,0:20:57.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,...can I pretend you didn't just say that and still have sex with you anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.72,0:21:01.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,I can't do it. I' m sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.53,0:21:05.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Well, can you at least point me in the direction of someone who can?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.33,0:21:08.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,That guy over there could help you out.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.70,0:21:14.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- Isn't that a woman? - Jeez, I' m not really sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.87,0:21:21.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,But you're too drunk to notice, remember? Take care.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.05,0:21:32.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- Hey, you. Aloha. - Aloha.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.72,0:21:36.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Not aloha, "hello," aloha, "goodbye." We're closed today. Go away.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.09,0:21:39.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- What are you talking about? - Order up!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.73,0:21:42.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- Don't move. I have to talk to you. - Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.47,0:21:45.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- Hey! Tattoo-Face! - Hey, Peanut Butter Cups!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.08,0:21:58.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.12,0:22:00.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.52,0:22:03.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,My fingers are extra fishy today, if you care to take a whiff.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.49,0:22:06.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,What was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.92,0:22:10.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,I was petting my walrus all morning and thinking of you the whole time.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.53,0:22:14.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Okay, pervert. I think that you should leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.83,0:22:18.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,What? I was joking because of what we talked about yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.44,0:22:20.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Yesterday?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.07,0:22:23.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,I've never even met you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.27,0:22:26.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- Nick! I need help! - Coming, Lucy.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.41,0:22:29.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Nick, put that down. I'll handle it.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.45,0:22:32.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- You, follow me. - Wait a... What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.92,0:22:35.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,I was kidding around with you!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.55,0:22:39.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,What's happening here? Is she crazy or something?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.49,0:22:44.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Lucy is a very special person. Very different from other people.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.73,0:22:46.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.43,0:22:50.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,About a year ago, Lucy was in a terrible car accident.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.60,0:22:54.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,She and her father went up North Shore to get a pineapple.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.07,0:23:35.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Her father broke some ribs, but Lucy suffered a serious head injury.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.98,0:23:38.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,She lost her short-term memory.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.32,0:23:41.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,So she can't remember anything?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.19,0:23:43.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,No, no, no, she has all of her long-term memory.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.02,0:23:45.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,That's a different part of the brain.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.02,0:23:50.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Her whole life, up to the night before the accident, she remembers.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.36,0:23:53.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,She just can't retain any new information.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.30,0:23:57.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,It's like her slate gets wiped clean every night while she sleeps.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.14,0:24:01.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Hold on. This sounds like something I would tell a psycho girl...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.61,0:24:04.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,...so she'd stop calling me. Am I the psycho girl
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.37,0:24:06.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,I wish I was making this up!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.44,0:24:09.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,She has no memory that she ever met you.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.38,0:24:11.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,What about the pineapple -picking thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.62,0:24:14.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,She says that every day, because each morning...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.18,0:24:17.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,...she wakes up thinking it's October 13th of last year.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.65,0:24:20.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,She comes for breakfast because that's what she did on Sundays...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.12,0:24:23.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,...and October 13th was a Sunday.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.53,0:24:27.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,She has no idea it's more than a year later.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.33,0:24:28.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,She reads the newspaper.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.03,0:24:31.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,It's a special paper her father puts on their porch.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.14,0:24:35.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,It's from the day of her accident. He got hundreds of them printed.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.91,0:24:40.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Lucy does the same thing every day.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.49,0:24:52.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- Hello! - Back here.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.52,0:24:55.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- Hi, Dad! - Oh, hi, sweetie.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.03,0:24:58.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,You got one without me.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.96,0:25:02.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,The lady at the farmers' market gave it to me as a birthday present.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.60,0:25:05.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,I didn't wanna hurt her feelings.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:07.14,0:25:08.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,I think she likes you.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:09.11,0:25:12.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- Yeah, what's not to like? - What about our tradition?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:12.74,0:25:16.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Well, I have another idea. I painted my workshop yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.55,0:25:19.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,White.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:19.78,0:25:22.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Now it's too white. Gives me a headache.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:22.32,0:25:24.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, yeah, you definitely need some color in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.06,0:25:28.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Well, you know, that's what I was thinking.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:28.39,0:25:30.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- Really? - Yeah. Go nuts.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:30.49,0:25:33.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- Paint me something for my birthday. - I will.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:34.50,0:25:37.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,And promise that we can pick a pineapple for Thanksgiving, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.04,0:25:41.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- Sounds great. - Okay, good.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.31,0:25:44.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, you should watch the Vikings game while I' m painting.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:45.38,0:25:47.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Good idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:51.65,0:25:55.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- Yeah, baby. Isolate. - What are we eating tonight, Doug?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:55.79,0:25:58.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- Spaghetti, Pop. - Try not to sweat in the sauce.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:58.82,0:26:00.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry, Pop.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:07.50,0:26:08.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Go Vikings.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.87,0:26:13.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Seven hundred and five. Seven hundred and six.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.34,0:26:15.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- Seven hundred and seven. - Hey, you guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:15.91,0:26:18.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, sweetie. How's the painting coming?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.18,0:26:20.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- You'll see. - Cool
Dialogue: 0,0:26:20.21,0:26:23.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- Oh. What's the score? - The Vikings are on the two-yard line.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:23.58,0:26:27.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- Lf they score, they bring it to 14-10. - Maybe they'll win for your birthday.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:28.42,0:26:30.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,And I' II bet Culpepper runs it in.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:30.92,0:26:35.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,I'll bet he fakes a handoff to Williams, throws to Kleinsasser in the end zone.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:35.36,0:26:38.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- Loser does the dishes? - You're on.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:38.26,0:26:40.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- Keep the offense on the field.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:40.36,0:26:43.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Culpepper fakes a handoff to Williams. He will throw.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:43.30,0:26:46.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,He's got Kleinsasser in the end zone! Touchdown, Minnesota.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:46.44,0:26:47.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Doug, you're good.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:49.01,0:26:50.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Maybe you should be a coach.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:55.21,0:26:57.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- Dad. - Moron!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:57.61,0:26:59.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,That hurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:12.56,0:27:14.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,And you don't look a day over 25.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:14.40,0:27:17.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, right, and Doug's muscles aren't pharmaceutically enhanced.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:17.83,0:27:19.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,What? I use an herb supplement...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:19.67,0:27:23.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,...that can be purchased at any health-food store. Check this out.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:23.17,0:27:25.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Check out these glutes. Rock-hard, baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:26.24,0:27:27.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Pretty sweet, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:27.64,0:27:30.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Stop it! You're gonna make me throw up on the cake.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:30.58,0:27:32.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Okay, just open your present.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:32.22,0:27:35.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Okay. Let's see what we've got here.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:36.32,0:27:38.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,The Sixth Sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:38.62,0:27:42.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Hey! When I' m done doing the dishes, do you guys wanna watch it?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:42.76,0:27:44.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- Sure. - Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:45.13,0:27:47.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Ben Friedkin?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:47.50,0:27:50.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Some people, they call me freak.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:51.84,0:27:57.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- Ronald Sumner? - I am. I am a freak. Look at me.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:58.14,0:27:59.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Just give me a chance...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:03.98,0:28:07.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,I can't believe it. Bruce Willis is a ghost.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:07.72,0:28:09.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,I'm shocked. Did you see that coming?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:10.09,0:28:11.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- No. - Not a clue.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:11.35,0:28:14.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- Shocked as hell. - Anyway, it was awesome.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:14.69,0:28:16.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- Happy birthday. - Love you, Sis.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:16.79,0:28:20.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Your muscles are getting so big, I can barely wrap my arms around you.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:20.76,0:28:22.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,You like that? Check this out.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:27.04,0:28:31.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Okay, okay! Enough with the titty dance! Let your sister go to sleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:31.54,0:28:33.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- I like it. - Sweet dreams, Lucy.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:33.58,0:28:35.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- Good night. - Good night.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:25.66,0:29:27.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, Tracy, how you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:27.56,0:29:28.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:28.97,0:29:31.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Well, things changed a little bit since high school
Dialogue: 0,0:30:01.33,0:30:04.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,And this is what happens every single day.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:04.33,0:30:06.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,How long it gonna take for her memory to come back?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:07.04,0:30:09.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Her doctors say it may never come back.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:09.54,0:30:12.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,So, basically, what you're saying is...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:13.74,0:30:16.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,...she's perfect for you. - What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:16.21,0:30:18.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,You can hang out all day with no attachment, because...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:19.08,0:30:22.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Her plane leaves every night? There's a problem with that.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:22.19,0:30:23.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- What is? - It 's evil
Dialogue: 0,0:30:24.02,0:30:25.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,No, it isn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:25.42,0:30:28.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,You meet her, hang out, flirt, no commitment, nobody gets hurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:28.96,0:30:32.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- She's got brain damage, you psycho. - Okay, I' II give you that one.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:33.10,0:30:34.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,But I think it'd be healthy for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:35.10,0:30:38.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,You haven't allowed yourself to connect with a girl
Dialogue: 0,0:30:38.27,0:30:40.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,I appreciate your interest, but leave me alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:40.94,0:30:43.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, you'd be doing exactly what her father does:
Dialogue: 0,0:30:44.04,0:30:45.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Giving her a wonderful day.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:46.04,0:30:50.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,When it's time for you to go on your big boat trip, poof, you just leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:50.31,0:30:52.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,She'll never even know you're gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:52.25,0:30:55.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,I'm not sure about the "poofing" part, because I' m not a good poofer.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:55.79,0:30:57.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Demonstrate a good poof for me?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:57.52,0:31:00.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Quit busting my coconuts for five seconds.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:00.36,0:31:03.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,All right. Would you stop poofing on that joint and do some work?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:04.43,0:31:08.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Okay. Let's get this sucker ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:08.40,0:31:11.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Then we're gonna take her out for a spin.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:13.74,0:31:16.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Captain's log: November 7 th. Nearly midnight.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:17.01,0:31:19.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,The Sea Serpent is fully recovered from her mishap...
Dialogue: 0,0:31:19.88,0:31:22.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,...and ready to once again brave the open ocean.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:25.55,0:31:28.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,I think my stitches opened up again, cuz.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:28.49,0:31:31.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,You got a cat? Because I feel something licking me.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:43.03,0:31:44.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,How is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:44.67,0:31:46.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Peanut Butter Cups. What are you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:47.04,0:31:49.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,I just wanted to say hi to Lucy.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:51.27,0:31:53.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,I promise you I' m not gonna do anything wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:53.74,0:31:54.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,What did Sue say?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:55.15,0:31:58.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,She said that if I talk to Lucy, you'll kill me with a meat cleaver.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:58.85,0:32:01.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,She's the boss, cuz. But don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:02.02,0:32:04.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Lucy probably didn't wanna talk to you anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:06.16,0:32:08.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- What does that mean? - This ain't a disco.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:08.59,0:32:11.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,She doesn't want guys hitting on her during her breakfast.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:12.00,0:32:13.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,She does if it's Henry Roth.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:13.63,0:32:15.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- Who that? - Who that? Me that.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:15.50,0:32:19.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,I bet you 20 bucks I can get her to have breakfast with me again.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:22.14,0:32:24.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- You're on. - I love it.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:25.41,0:32:29.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- How you doing, honey? - Hey, Sue. Nice haircut.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:29.48,0:32:32.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, mahalo. See you in a bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:32.55,0:32:36.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Nick and I have an arrangement. You can trust me.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:36.79,0:32:38.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:01.04,0:33:03.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,You should try this out. Put it in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:03.65,0:33:05.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Swivelly door.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:05.98,0:33:08.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Waffleonians can come in and out now.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:09.25,0:33:12.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Are you from a country where it's okay to stick your fingers...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:12.62,0:33:14.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,...all over someone else's food?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:15.36,0:33:17.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,No, I' m from this country.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:17.76,0:33:20.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Why? Were you gonna eat that? Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:20.33,0:33:22.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,All right, well, have a good meal
Dialogue: 0,0:33:28.10,0:33:30.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- Yeah. - That was pathetic.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:30.47,0:33:32.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah? Why don't you choke on your Spam?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:32.71,0:33:34.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Double or nothing tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:42.35,0:33:44.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Hey. I' m sorry to bother you...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:44.82,0:33:47.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,...but you look like a person who appreciates fine art...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:47.86,0:33:49.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,...so I wanted your opinion.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:49.76,0:33:56.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,I drew this. It 's a picture of a father and son fishing off a fishing boat.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:56.57,0:33:58.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,There's a walrus right there...
Dialogue: 0,0:34:03.74,0:34:06.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, you don't speak English. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:09.55,0:34:12.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Doesn't look Chinese.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:12.25,0:34:14.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Forty.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:15.89,0:34:17.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Can I have that?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:17.42,0:34:20.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,I need something to wipe my ass with.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:20.56,0:34:21.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Shut up.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:47.22,0:34:49.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,I wonder what's the matter with him.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:49.32,0:34:51.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Looks like a stupid asshole to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:59.00,0:35:01.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Excuse me. Okay. I didn't mean to startle you.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:01.76,0:35:03.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- No, that's all right. L- - - Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:03.97,0:35:06.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, I' m fine. I' m having a problem with something...
Dialogue: 0,0:35:06.94,0:35:08.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Something that I could help you with?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:08.97,0:35:10.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,No, no, no. I just...
Dialogue: 0,0:35:10.94,0:35:13.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,...can't read.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:14.94,0:35:17.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,You gotta be kidding me.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:17.31,0:35:19.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- I can read that for you. - No. Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:19.52,0:35:21.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,I can do this on my own.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:21.45,0:35:23.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Appreciate the sentiment.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:23.65,0:35:26.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,I'm gonna get an order of the...
Dialogue: 0,0:35:37.00,0:35:38.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Pan...
Dialogue: 0,0:35:38.50,0:35:40.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Pan...
Dialogue: 0,0:35:42.41,0:35:43.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Panku...
Dialogue: 0,0:35:44.14,0:35:45.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Ca...
Dialogue: 0,0:35:45.84,0:35:47.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Panclocks.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:47.58,0:35:50.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- Pancakes. - Okay, I' II have pancake.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:50.41,0:35:52.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- Pancakes. - Pancah... Pancakes! Pancakes!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:52.95,0:35:54.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- I' m so stupid! - Oh, don't cry.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:54.72,0:35:58.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- Stupid. Stupid. Stupid. - Don't cry.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:58.59,0:36:01.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- I don't know anything! - What a loser.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:05.36,0:36:07.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,I'll tell you what. Why don't you sit with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:07.83,0:36:11.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,You can have some breakfast and I'll help teach you some of the words.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:11.63,0:36:13.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- Okay. - All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:13.60,0:36:15.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- That sounds nice. - Come on over.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:15.67,0:36:17.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- Okay, thank you. - All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:23.85,0:36:27.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,So I comes before the E?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:27.35,0:36:29.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- Except after C? - Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:29.82,0:36:32.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Okay, and C is that little half a squiggly one, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:32.79,0:36:34.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- Yes. - I think I' m getting it.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:35.09,0:36:38.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- How'd you get so good at teaching? - I' m a teacher. I do it all the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:38.76,0:36:41.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,I'm an art teacher at the Haluki-liki Junior High.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:41.73,0:36:45.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Well, you Haluki-liki the kind of teacher all the kids have crushes on.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:45.97,0:36:48.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,I know I would if I was in your class.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:52.28,0:36:54.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:54.28,0:36:56.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, boy, do my... My fingers smell like fish.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:57.08,0:36:58.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,That doesn't gross you out, does it?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:59.08,0:37:00.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,No, not at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:01.02,0:37:02.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:05.59,0:37:08.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,If Lucy gets hurt, I' m gonna chop you with the meat cleaver.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:08.79,0:37:10.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Okay, okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:12.23,0:37:13.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,So I had a nice time.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:14.03,0:37:16.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- Yeah, me too. - Thank you very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:16.93,0:37:18.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- Let me get it for you. - Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:18.84,0:37:20.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:20.57,0:37:22.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:29.31,0:37:34.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,I just want to eat you up, tomorrow and the next day, next day, next day...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:35.49,0:37:37.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,I'll see you around.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:37.59,0:37:39.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:43.19,0:37:44.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Really? That's it?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:45.33,0:37:48.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- That's what? - All that flirting...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:48.73,0:37:52.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,...and phony "I can't read" stuff, and you're not gonna ask me out...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:52.37,0:37:53.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,...or for my phone number?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:53.87,0:37:56.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- I can't read. - Oh, shut up.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:56.34,0:37:59.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,That was one of the goofiest things I've ever seen, but I thought:
Dialogue: 0,0:37:59.84,0:38:02.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,"Hey, if this guy is so desperate to meet me...
Dialogue: 0,0:38:02.85,0:38:05.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,...he might be worth talking to."
Dialogue: 0,0:38:05.38,0:38:07.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,But then I get stiffed.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:07.48,0:38:09.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,No, no, no, this is what happened. I...
Dialogue: 0,0:38:10.05,0:38:12.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Mahalo for the ego boost.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:12.56,0:38:15.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- You're right. You're right. I feel like... - No worries.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:16.49,0:38:18.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,I gotta... I can read a little!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:18.69,0:38:22.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,I didn't know I came before E! That one I didn't know, I swear.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:22.33,0:38:24.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, you idiot.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:24.33,0:38:26.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,I hope you're happy, Shamu.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:30.87,0:38:32.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Marlin. It 's Sue.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:44.55,0:38:48.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- Oh, aloha, sir. My name's Henry... - I know who you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:50.56,0:38:53.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- I want to apologize to your daughter. - Not gonna happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:53.70,0:38:56.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,She's inside. We're gonna straighten things out.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:56.37,0:38:59.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Dad, the damn mongoose got in the garbage again!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:01.60,0:39:03.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- Is this the guy? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:03.77,0:39:06.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Mr. Roth, I have one simple request:
Dialogue: 0,0:39:06.91,0:39:08.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Stay away from my daughter.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:08.71,0:39:12.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Absolutely. I hurt her feelings and don't want it to end like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:12.45,0:39:13.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,It's gonna end like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:15.05,0:39:16.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Calm down, little fellow.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:16.72,0:39:19.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,I'm gonna kill you! You're a dead man. Okay, I' m calm.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:20.12,0:39:21.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,I'm calm.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:22.09,0:39:24.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- Let me help you up. - I got it! I got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:24.59,0:39:29.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,It's just Dad and I work too hard to protect Lucy to let some idiot ruin it.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:29.27,0:39:31.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,I know what you guys do and I totally respect that.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:32.07,0:39:35.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,If you know her condition, you know she can't have a normal relationship.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:35.97,0:39:38.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,The next morning, she won't know who he is.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:38.27,0:39:40.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,And any guy who's okay with that...
Dialogue: 0,0:39:40.54,0:39:42.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,...ain't okay with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:42.25,0:39:46.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- I' m not looking for a one-night stand. - Anything with Lucy is, numb-nuts.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:46.38,0:39:50.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Give us a break. Just stay away from the Hukilau Cafe.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:50.65,0:39:52.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,My daughter's been through enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:54.29,0:39:55.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Okay. I' m sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:00.80,0:40:03.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,I could have whooped his ass, but this gravel, I slipped on it...
Dialogue: 0,0:40:04.17,0:40:07.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, well, maybe you need to do a few more butt flexes.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:07.70,0:40:09.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Cheap shot, Dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:10.17,0:40:11.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,So fresh and so clean.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:12.01,0:40:15.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, Alexa, did you hook up with that girl from the bar?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:15.28,0:40:17.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- I chickened out. - Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:17.61,0:40:20.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, I don't know. I guess I prefer sausage to taco.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:21.92,0:40:24.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- What? - Yeah. No, I agree, buddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:24.62,0:40:27.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Get out of here. Run for the hills.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:28.29,0:40:30.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Let me ask you something, Alexa.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:30.26,0:40:33.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,If you promised a girl' s dad that you wouldn't see her...
Dialogue: 0,0:40:33.43,0:40:35.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,...would you consider that a binding promise?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:35.90,0:40:37.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- Absolutely. - Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:37.60,0:40:40.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Then again, there are always ways around such things.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:40.47,0:40:42.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- Like? - For example...
Dialogue: 0,0:40:42.41,0:40:46.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,...if I promised a woman's father I would not see her...
Dialogue: 0,0:40:46.84,0:40:50.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,...I would simply shut my eyes while she serviced my manhood.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:52.68,0:40:54.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,That's actually a cool way to look at it.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:54.95,0:40:56.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,And a very gross way.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:13.07,0:41:16.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,He asked me not to go to the Hukilau. I'm not going there.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:16.61,0:41:18.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,I'm not doing anything wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:25.18,0:41:27.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry to bother you. I'm kind of stuck here.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:28.42,0:41:31.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- Car trouble? - Yeah. You mind giving me a jump?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:31.95,0:41:33.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:33.56,0:41:35.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Appreciate your time.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:35.39,0:41:37.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Not everybody would have stopped.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:37.26,0:41:39.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- You're real sweet. - Oh, yeah. Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:45.67,0:41:48.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,I can't believe you fell for that.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:49.07,0:41:52.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Well, my grandfather died trying to jump-start a car.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:56.21,0:41:59.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,I'm sorry. I was just joking around.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:59.38,0:42:02.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,I can't believe you fell for that!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:02.95,0:42:04.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:04.82,0:42:06.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,That was very good.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:06.56,0:42:08.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- My name's Henry. - I' m Lucy.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:08.89,0:42:11.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Nice to meet you. You look like a nice...
Dialogue: 0,0:42:17.10,0:42:20.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Hi. Sorry for the delay. Should be a few minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:20.60,0:42:23.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- No problem. No worries. - Where you coming from?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:23.71,0:42:25.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Breakfast?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:25.51,0:42:26.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- Yeah. - How was it?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:27.11,0:42:28.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,I had waffles. They were delicious.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:29.08,0:42:31.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Ilike making little houses out of waffles.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:33.12,0:42:35.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- You do? - That's my thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:38.09,0:42:39.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- What's your name? - Lucy.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:39.62,0:42:40.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Hi, I' m Henry.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:41.12,0:42:44.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Okay, pal When she stops, just let her pet you. Look cute.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:44.29,0:42:47.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Go to the middle of the road. Thank you. Right there. Perfect.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:53.97,0:42:56.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- Oh, shit. - Here she comes. Smile.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:00.14,0:43:01.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Where is she?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:04.91,0:43:06.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, my God. Oh, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:08.95,0:43:10.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Okay. That didn't work.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:10.99,0:43:13.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Shit your pants? So did I
Dialogue: 0,0:43:19.36,0:43:21.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Okay, this is her. Start beating me up.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:21.50,0:43:23.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Make it look good.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:26.44,0:43:28.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Give me your wallet!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:28.64,0:43:31.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Okay, haole, what do you think? You can come to this island...
Dialogue: 0,0:43:31.91,0:43:34.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,...eat our pineapple... - Help me! Not so hard.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:34.98,0:43:37.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- Take it easy. - Try to bang our women.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:37.25,0:43:39.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Making my sister clean your hotel room.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:39.68,0:43:41.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Okay. What's that have to do with this? Relax.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:42.15,0:43:44.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- Hey! Hey! Help me, please! - Stupid haole!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:45.82,0:43:49.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, that's right. Take that! And that! And that!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:49.19,0:43:50.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,And that! And that!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:50.83,0:43:53.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,You got him. You got him. Enough. Enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:53.26,0:43:54.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- Are you okay? - Yes, yes...
Dialogue: 0,0:43:54.73,0:43:56.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Okay, I' II be back. Come here!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:56.40,0:43:58.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,No, no! I think he's had enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:58.90,0:44:00.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:01.54,0:44:03.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,My eye!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:05.01,0:44:07.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- You got him! - Not good enough!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:07.41,0:44:08.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, Kamehameha!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:08.84,0:44:10.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,He learned his lesson!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:11.31,0:44:13.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- What's your name? - My name's Henry.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:13.55,0:44:15.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- You did good. - Hi. Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:15.55,0:44:17.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,I'm in a community-watch program...
Dialogue: 0,0:44:17.49,0:44:19.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, you crazy bitch!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:19.72,0:44:21.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, keep running!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:21.66,0:44:24.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Okay, okay, he's... He's gone now.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:30.87,0:44:32.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Not her. False alarm.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:36.54,0:44:39.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Don't worry, I called the cops already. I'm all set.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:39.81,0:44:42.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah? You all set for this, Mr. Smarty?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:45.08,0:44:47.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- Oh, shit. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:47.18,0:44:50.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,When you're finished playing your kidnap-victim crap on my daughter...
Dialogue: 0,0:44:50.89,0:44:52.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,...come by the house.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:52.29,0:44:54.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:02.00,0:45:03.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:11.14,0:45:12.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,There's something I wanna show you.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:23.42,0:45:26.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,We figured it out. She only sings on days she meets you.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:26.69,0:45:28.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,You're kidding me. That song?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:28.82,0:45:30.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,That's Mom and Dad's song.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:30.43,0:45:33.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,When her mom was alive, Lucy would have me take that tape...
Dialogue: 0,0:45:33.63,0:45:36.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,...on every fishing trip I went on. - Oh, yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:36.40,0:45:38.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, she knew it would make me miss her mom...
Dialogue: 0,0:45:38.90,0:45:40.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,...and want to come home sooner.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:40.84,0:45:45.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,I'm seeing a new side to you, sir. I gotta tell you, it's grossing me out.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:46.78,0:45:48.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Let me ask you something.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:48.28,0:45:51.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,What's in it for you? What do you get out of this?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:53.15,0:45:54.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:59.59,0:46:02.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Wouldn't you want to spend an hour a day with that?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:02.29,0:46:05.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Actually, no. She sings like shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:05.49,0:46:07.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- What? - Can I ask you guys something?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:08.13,0:46:10.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,What'll happen down the line? Someday she'll wake up...
Dialogue: 0,0:46:11.13,0:46:14.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,...look in the mirror and notice she aged 10 years overnight.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:14.60,0:46:16.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,You know something, Henry?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:16.91,0:46:19.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,I worry about that every damn day of my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:24.71,0:46:26.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Pardon me.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:26.38,0:46:29.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry to interrupt, but I noticed we were both eating alone...
Dialogue: 0,0:46:29.65,0:46:33.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,...and I thought I could sit with you, maybe build a syrup Jacuzzi...
Dialogue: 0,0:46:33.29,0:46:36.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,...for your waffle house? - Oh, that would be nice...
Dialogue: 0,0:46:36.69,0:46:38.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,...but I have a boyfriend.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:39.16,0:46:41.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,So I' m sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:43.03,0:46:45.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,You're making up a boyfriend to get rid of me?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:45.57,0:46:46.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,No, I' m not.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:47.14,0:46:49.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,What's his name, then?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:49.41,0:46:50.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Ringo.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:51.41,0:46:52.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Is his last name Starr?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:53.31,0:46:56.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- No. McCartney. - McCartney, okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:56.98,0:46:58.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- Oh, no. - All right. I' m sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:58.98,0:47:01.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,No! This cop is writing me a ticket!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:01.55,0:47:03.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, whoa, whoa. I wouldn't go out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:03.72,0:47:05.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- Wait, wait, wait! - Go on!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:05.29,0:47:06.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,I'm coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:06.82,0:47:08.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,The tags don't expire for seven months.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:08.99,0:47:11.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- They expired May of this year. - No! No, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:11.96,0:47:13.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,They expire May of next year.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:13.60,0:47:15.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,I think there's been a misunderstanding.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:15.76,0:47:17.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- I don't. - This is ridiculous.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:17.67,0:47:19.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,I'm not paying for this! It's October!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:20.24,0:47:22.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Excuse me. Can I borrow this? Look, October!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:22.87,0:47:24.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Lucy, let's go back inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:25.91,0:47:27.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:37.55,0:47:39.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:45.53,0:47:47.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Having a bad day, Doug!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:28.84,0:48:30.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Sweetheart...
Dialogue: 0,0:48:31.41,0:48:33.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,...these are from the accident.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:50.46,0:48:53.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:00.30,0:49:02.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,I can feel it.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:04.97,0:49:08.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,You were in the hospital for three months, sweetheart.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:21.62,0:49:25.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,I have to talk to this doctor. I need to hear it from him.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:25.99,0:49:27.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,You have heard it, sweetie. Many times.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:29.90,0:49:31.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,I have?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:32.84,0:49:34.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,I'll take her.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:35.90,0:49:38.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,I have to hear for myself too.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:49.28,0:49:51.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Doug, just take this, okay? I can't...
Dialogue: 0,0:49:51.65,0:49:54.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,I can't look at it anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:54.82,0:49:58.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- It 's gonna be all right, Luce. - Don't call me Luce. I barely know you.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:58.89,0:50:01.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Sweetie, you're sort of dating him.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:02.53,0:50:04.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry I' m not better-looking.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:06.94,0:50:09.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,What else happened since last October?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:09.74,0:50:13.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- What about my students? - Miss Campbell took over your class.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:16.58,0:50:19.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- Did Alicia marry that guy? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:19.68,0:50:22.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Doug, did you win the Mr. Hawaii contest?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:22.22,0:50:24.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,I didn't know there was gonna be a urine test.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:25.05,0:50:26.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:27.39,0:50:28.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Do we have sex?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:30.73,0:50:34.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,No, we don't. Just so everybody knows that.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:35.26,0:50:36.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,We want to.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:37.93,0:50:39.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Just kidding.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:43.71,0:50:47.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,So you guys have to just lie to me every day.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:00.79,0:51:02.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, Lucy. Good to see you again.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:06.20,0:51:08.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,What the hell 's her problem?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:08.46,0:51:10.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,She doesn't remember who you are, brah.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:11.17,0:51:13.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:13.20,0:51:15.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,I suck at this job.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:17.37,0:51:19.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Lucy, these are your brain scans here.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:19.47,0:51:21.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,I'm afraid they show no improvement.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:21.68,0:51:24.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,The temporal lobe was severely damaged.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:24.35,0:51:27.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,What we believe is scar tissue here is impairing your ability...
Dialogue: 0,0:51:27.75,0:51:31.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,...to convert short-term memory into long-term memory while you sleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:31.59,0:51:34.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,The condition's come to be known as Goldfield Syndrome.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:34.52,0:51:37.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- Who's Goldfield? - A brilliant Lithuanian psychiatrist.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:37.89,0:51:39.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,He himself suffered temporal-lobe damage.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:40.10,0:51:42.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Took him four years to publish his findings...
Dialogue: 0,0:51:42.36,0:51:45.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,...because he had to keep starting over from scratch.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:45.50,0:51:48.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Obviously, your sense of humor is still intact, and that's here.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:49.04,0:51:50.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Magnificent amygdala as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:50.97,0:51:53.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- Doctor, I have a question. - I' d be happy to answer it...
Dialogue: 0,0:51:54.04,0:51:58.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,...but as I' ve told you before, this is a hygienic facility. Shirts are required.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:58.61,0:52:00.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- Oh, okay. - Nice move.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:02.15,0:52:03.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Listen, doctor, this...
Dialogue: 0,0:52:04.02,0:52:07.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,...friend of mine's been experimenting a little with steroids.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:07.82,0:52:09.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,He's been having a lot of wet dreams.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:10.13,0:52:12.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Could there be a connection between them?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:12.33,0:52:14.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Douglas, get off the juice.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:14.33,0:52:17.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,As for the nocturnal emissions, why don't you take a swim...
Dialogue: 0,0:52:17.53,0:52:21.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,...buy a shirt with no holes, find a wahine and take her to dinner.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:21.57,0:52:23.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,I'll tell my friend you said so.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:24.47,0:52:27.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,In any case, Lucy, your condition is stable...
Dialogue: 0,0:52:27.38,0:52:28.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,...but most likely permanent.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:29.41,0:52:31.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,I'm so sorry, dear.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:31.71,0:52:33.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,But it could be worse.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:35.02,0:52:36.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah? How?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:36.55,0:52:39.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,I think you should meet Ten Second Tom.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:39.79,0:52:43.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Callahan Institute is the leading brain-injury clinic in the Pacific Rim.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:43.69,0:52:46.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,We are funded out of Sandusky, Ohio by T.B. Callahan...
Dialogue: 0,0:52:47.13,0:52:50.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,...the automotive-components tycoon and philanthropist.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:55.34,0:52:57.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,And now, I would like to introduce to you...
Dialogue: 0,0:52:58.04,0:53:00.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,...our most distinguished clinical subject...
Dialogue: 0,0:53:01.04,0:53:02.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,...Tom.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:02.61,0:53:04.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- Hi. I' m Tom. - Henry.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:04.38,0:53:05.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- Marlin. - Doug.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:05.78,0:53:07.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- Lucy. - Hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:07.18,0:53:09.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Cool flip-flops. Where'd you get them?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:09.52,0:53:12.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,You like those? It 's interesting. I was on the North Shore...
Dialogue: 0,0:53:12.72,0:53:13.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Hi, I' m Tom.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:14.76,0:53:16.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- Henry. - Hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:16.89,0:53:18.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- Marlin. - Tom lost part of his brain...
Dialogue: 0,0:53:19.06,0:53:21.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,...in a hunting accident. His memory lasts 10 seconds.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:21.93,0:53:23.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,I was in an accident? That's terrible.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:23.90,0:53:26.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Don't worry. You'll get over it in seconds.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:26.20,0:53:29.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Get over it? I mean, what happened? Did I get shot in the brain?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:29.84,0:53:32.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- Hi, I' m Tom. - Hi, I' m Lucy.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:32.24,0:53:33.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- Hi. - Doug.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:33.68,0:53:34.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- Hey. - Marlin.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:35.08,0:53:37.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, Tom, can I tell you a secret?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:40.08,0:53:43.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Don't you think you're a little old to still have wet dreams?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:46.79,0:53:49.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- They liked that. - Hi, I' m Tom.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:49.79,0:53:52.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- Yeah, watch yourself, Tom. - Easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:06.34,0:54:08.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- I' m gonna go to sleep. - All right. Good night.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:08.91,0:54:11.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Good night, you guys. I'll see you tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:12.98,0:54:15.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- And I guess I' II see you too? - Oh, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:16.18,0:54:18.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,You had a rough day today. I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:18.42,0:54:20.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,I hope you get some rest tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:21.06,0:54:22.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:22.79,0:54:24.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Good night.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:24.63,0:54:25.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,So how you getting home?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:26.06,0:54:28.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- You gonna take the Likelike or... - Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:30.63,0:54:33.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you for being so nice to me today.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:33.54,0:54:36.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- Sure. - I don't want you to...
Dialogue: 0,0:54:36.27,0:54:37.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,...strike out tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:38.14,0:54:40.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,So maybe you could talk to me about...
Dialogue: 0,0:54:40.71,0:54:41.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,...lilies.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:42.38,0:54:43.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Lilies?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:43.78,0:54:45.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,I'm a sucker for lilies.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:45.85,0:54:47.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Thanks for the tip.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:47.65,0:54:49.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Good night.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:49.32,0:54:50.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Good night.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:51.05,0:54:53.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,My, oh, my.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:53.49,0:54:55.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- Lover-boy. - Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:55.66,0:54:57.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,You don't have to rush off. Stick around.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:58.49,0:55:00.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,You've earned yourself a couple beers.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:02.06,0:55:04.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,So what'll you do when you finish the boat?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:04.37,0:55:06.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Actually, I' m going on a trip soon...
Dialogue: 0,0:55:06.40,0:55:08.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,...to study undersea Pacific walrus behaviors.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:08.97,0:55:10.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Sounds kind of fruity.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:10.47,0:55:12.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- Thank you. - How long is it gonna take?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:12.87,0:55:14.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,About a year.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:14.28,0:55:16.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Guess you won't miss days like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:16.85,0:55:19.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Well, maybe days like this don't have to be so bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:19.71,0:55:21.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,What are you trying to say?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:22.65,0:55:24.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,When you guys tell her...
Dialogue: 0,0:55:24.19,0:55:26.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,...she's not just finding out about the accident.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:26.89,0:55:30.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,She's finding out that her life is basically a setup.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:30.39,0:55:32.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,I think that freaks her out the most.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:32.53,0:55:33.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- You're an expert now? - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:34.10,0:55:36.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,I'm saying I wish there was another way besides:
Dialogue: 0,0:55:36.70,0:55:40.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,"Sorry we couldn't trick you today. Here's pictures of your broken head."
Dialogue: 0,0:55:40.57,0:55:42.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- You want a broken head? - You'll give him one?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:43.11,0:55:45.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,No, Daddy, I thought you was gonna do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:45.71,0:55:48.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Nobody's gotta break my head. I'm gonna split anyways.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:48.64,0:55:51.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, don't go just because my son is psychotic.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:51.38,0:55:54.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Good night. Sweet dreams. Keep them dry there, Doug.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:55.15,0:55:56.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Very funny.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:18.21,0:56:20.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- Excuse me. Lucy Whitmore? - Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:21.04,0:56:23.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,I have a delivery for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:23.95,0:56:26.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- A delivery for me? - Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:28.05,0:56:30.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, they're beautiful
Dialogue: 0,0:56:31.15,0:56:33.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- Who are they from? - That I can't tell you.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:33.72,0:56:37.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,It's a secret admirer. He also wants you to have this.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:37.79,0:56:41.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- Who's your friend, Lucy? - Oh, well, I mean, I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:41.30,0:56:43.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,We just met, but look.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:43.93,0:56:45.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,I have a secret admirer.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:45.93,0:56:48.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, really? What's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:48.74,0:56:50.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,It's a videotape.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:50.64,0:56:52.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,A videotape of what?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:52.27,0:56:54.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,I have no idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:55.04,0:56:56.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,But I have to find out.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:57.71,0:56:59.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Happy birthday, Daddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:59.38,0:57:02.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- Thank you, sweetie. - That's right. Happy birthday, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:02.58,0:57:04.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- What are you, 200 today? - That's cute.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:04.69,0:57:07.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- What are you doing? - I wanted to try something different.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:07.89,0:57:10.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,If it doesn't work, we've only wasted one day.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:30.11,0:57:31.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Marha Stewar faced charges...
Dialogue: 0,0:57:34.22,0:57:35.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, God!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:16.69,0:58:18.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Okay, I think it's on. Go. Go.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:18.56,0:58:20.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Aloha! I'm Henry Roth.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:20.90,0:58:26.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,We met here at the Hukilau Cafe about a year after your accident.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:27.07,0:58:30.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,I like you and you like me, most days.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:30.61,0:58:33.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Every day is different, but basically this is what happens, Lucy.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:34.04,0:58:35.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Kikikoloko, take the camera.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:35.64,0:58:36.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- I got it. - Don't drop it.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:37.08,0:58:39.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Okay, all right. Here we are, right here.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:39.28,0:58:41.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,The par of you in this reenactment...
Dialogue: 0,0:58:41.72,0:58:44.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,...will be played by my good friend, Ula.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:45.22,0:58:47.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Aloha. Sorry about your brain.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:48.22,0:58:49.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,I had a accident too.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:49.79,0:58:52.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Believe it or not, this my good eye.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:53.63,0:58:54.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- We ready? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:55.03,0:58:58.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Hi. I like that waffle teepee that you have built.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:58.90,0:59:02.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Oh! So nice of you to notice. Please, sit down.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:02.97,0:59:04.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,I would love to.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:05.84,0:59:07.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,My name is Henry, by the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:07.68,0:59:09.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,My name is Lucy.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:09.74,0:59:11.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Smell my fingers?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:12.98,0:59:14.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Fish. Right on.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:15.25,0:59:18.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,So, Lucy, I work at an aquarium.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:18.42,0:59:20.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Aquariums make me super horny.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:21.16,0:59:23.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,That's not funny. Don't rub those.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:23.99,0:59:25.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry, Mr. Whitmore, if you're watching.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:26.16,0:59:28.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,It's very late, and my friend's unstable.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:28.40,0:59:31.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Come on, stop with the licking! You're making me sick.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:31.27,0:59:32.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Lucy, I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:32.97,0:59:37.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Anyways, I know you wish I was making all this stuff up.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:37.67,0:59:39.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,I wish I was too.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:40.81,0:59:42.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,But the good news is...
Dialogue: 0,0:59:42.61,0:59:44.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,...so many people out there care about you:
Dialogue: 0,0:59:44.95,0:59:48.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Your dad and Doug and a couple of your friends here at the Hukilau...
Dialogue: 0,0:59:48.78,0:59:50.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,...who have a message for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:50.62,0:59:54.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Lucy, as you know, your mother and I were best friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:55.62,0:59:59.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,That's why I promised her that I would always help look after you.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:01.33,1:00:04.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Sometimes life isn't very fair...
Dialogue: 0,1:00:05.60,1:00:07.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,...but we still have you.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:09.54,1:00:13.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, and if you're wondering about this guy who's making this tape...
Dialogue: 0,1:00:14.21,1:00:16.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,...he's okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:17.01,1:00:20.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, Lucy. Just so you know, since you lost your memory...
Dialogue: 0,1:00:20.85,1:00:23.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,...I became governor of Hawaii.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:23.95,1:00:26.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,No, just kidding. I'm too smar.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:28.72,1:00:32.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Kualaliku! Get your brother off the dishwasher!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:33.53,1:00:36.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,So whenever you're ready, we'd all love to talk to you...
Dialogue: 0,1:00:36.73,1:00:38.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,...and answer any questions you have...
Dialogue: 0,1:00:38.83,1:00:41.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,...and you're the best, Lucy. Aloha.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:56.52,1:00:59.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,How many times have I watched this?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:59.55,1:01:01.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,This is the first time.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:06.23,1:01:09.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Okay, she cried for about an hour. That's not too bad.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:09.23,1:01:12.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,I bet in another hour she'll be ready to see her friends, have lunch...
Dialogue: 0,1:01:13.00,1:01:14.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,...get her life back.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:14.40,1:01:16.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,We could do this every day.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:19.37,1:01:21.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,We'll leave it up to her.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:21.24,1:01:22.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:26.08,1:01:28.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,So how's the cow?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:28.45,1:01:31.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Same as you. Every day they have to convince her she's a cow.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:36.49,1:01:39.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Wow, look. The bark is healing.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:39.36,1:01:41.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,You're gonna get there.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:41.60,1:01:44.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,I never hung out with you in the afternoon like this.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:44.43,1:01:46.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,In this lighting, man, oh, man, you look...
Dialogue: 0,1:01:47.24,1:01:49.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,...disgusting.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:49.87,1:01:51.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:51.71,1:01:56.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,I don't know how you get me to fall for that egg-shaped head every morning.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:56.71,1:01:59.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,All I have to do is slide on my designer jeans...
Dialogue: 0,1:01:59.81,1:02:03.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,...and just kind of wiggle in front of you. You go nuts.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:04.82,1:02:08.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Why couldn't I have met you one day before the accident?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:08.66,1:02:12.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Don't worry, because if you hung out with me for more than one day...
Dialogue: 0,1:02:12.46,1:02:14.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,...you'd realize I' m a bore.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:14.76,1:02:16.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- Oh, well, I have news for you. - Yes?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:17.13,1:02:19.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,It takes less than one day.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:19.23,1:02:21.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,You know something? That hurt.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:21.40,1:02:24.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Your damaged temporal lobe is causing me pain...
Dialogue: 0,1:02:24.47,1:02:26.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,...and I' m gonna get you for that.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:27.68,1:02:29.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Now you're dead!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:48.16,1:02:51.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- I can't believe you're pregnant. - I know.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:51.50,1:02:54.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- And I got her on the first try. - Yeah. Easy.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:54.70,1:02:56.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,And, Tammy, you are so thin.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:56.67,1:02:58.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Thanks, Luce.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:58.17,1:02:59.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,And I' m so glad you finally got...
Dialogue: 0,1:03:00.14,1:03:03.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,...that gender-reassignment surgery, Jennifer. I mean, Jonathan.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:03.78,1:03:05.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Mahalo.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:06.35,1:03:07.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- Here you go, Lucy. - Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:08.05,1:03:10.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- You're welcome. - You must be Lucy's friend.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:10.42,1:03:13.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- The one who made the tape. - I think he's more than my friend.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:14.09,1:03:16.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- You're my boyfriend, right? - Yes, ma'am.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:16.29,1:03:18.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,So every day you help her to realize what happened...
Dialogue: 0,1:03:19.16,1:03:21.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,...and you wait patiently for her to be okay with it...
Dialogue: 0,1:03:22.10,1:03:24.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,...then get her to fall in love with you again?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:24.70,1:03:25.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Yes, ma'am.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:27.44,1:03:28.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,You asshole!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:28.84,1:03:31.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,You don't even open the fricking car door for me anymore.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:32.54,1:03:33.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,You're in trouble.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:35.38,1:03:37.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,I gotta go tinkle.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:41.15,1:03:44.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Okay, so tell me a little bit more about yourself.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:44.82,1:03:46.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Okay. Well, I' ve...
Dialogue: 0,1:03:47.06,1:03:50.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,...won over seven all -you-can-eat chicken-wing contests.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:50.43,1:03:52.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- Really? - Yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:52.73,1:03:55.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,And I' m a ballet dancer, but only in my bathroom.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:56.13,1:03:58.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,No, what do you want to know?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:00.34,1:04:01.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Do you love me?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:05.11,1:04:06.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,I didn't mean to put you on the spot.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:07.14,1:04:09.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,I was just asking more for informational purposes.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:10.08,1:04:12.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,It's to keep the video as up-to-date as possible.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:12.58,1:04:14.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Sure.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:15.48,1:04:19.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Well, love is a very loaded word.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:21.96,1:04:23.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Let's see. I...
Dialogue: 0,1:04:24.46,1:04:29.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,I go to this restaurant every morning, and I see you there, reading.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:30.13,1:04:32.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,And...
Dialogue: 0,1:04:34.40,1:04:36.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Ilove you very much.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:37.41,1:04:40.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Probably more than anybody could love another person.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:44.45,1:04:47.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,And how do I feel about you?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:47.78,1:04:50.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,You're excited about the chicken-wing thing.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:51.05,1:04:52.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,And...
Dialogue: 0,1:04:53.02,1:04:56.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,...you've been dying to make out with me for some time now.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:07.80,1:05:09.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Feeling better now?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:09.47,1:05:12.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Nothing beats a first kiss.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:19.88,1:05:23.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,There's nothing like a first kiss.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:45.54,1:05:47.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Nothing beats a first kiss.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:47.84,1:05:50.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,That's what I' ve heard.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:54.68,1:05:56.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Nothing beats a first...
Dialogue: 0,1:06:08.43,1:06:09.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:09.86,1:06:12.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Nothing. I was just getting some lint off for you.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:12.53,1:06:14.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,You were going for a feelski!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:14.67,1:06:19.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,All right, I' m sorry, but this is like the 23rd time we've made out already...
Dialogue: 0,1:06:19.74,1:06:21.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,...and they're getting blue.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:21.84,1:06:24.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,I know. I know.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:24.48,1:06:27.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,I mean, I really don't know.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:27.55,1:06:30.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,For me, it still feels like the first time.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:30.65,1:06:32.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Okay, let's average it out then.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:32.52,1:06:35.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,It's the 23rd time for me and the first time for you.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:35.62,1:06:37.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- That's about our 12th time. - Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:38.13,1:06:41.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Now, Hawaiian law clearly states after the 12th date...
Dialogue: 0,1:06:41.26,1:06:44.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,...I' m entitled to unlimited boob access.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:45.47,1:06:49.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Why didn't I meet you one day before the accident?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:50.91,1:06:53.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,You say that all the time.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:53.44,1:06:55.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,You want to meet a friend of mine?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:59.35,1:07:00.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:02.05,1:07:05.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Jocko, this is Lucy. Lucy, this is Jocko.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:06.22,1:07:09.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Wow! Thank you. Nice to meet you.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:10.66,1:07:13.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,He is awesome! He is so smart.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:13.36,1:07:17.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Check this out. Jocko, what does the teapot do when the water's ready?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:20.80,1:07:22.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- Very good. - Can I ask him a question?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:22.87,1:07:24.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Go ahead.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:24.97,1:07:26.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Jocko...
Dialogue: 0,1:07:26.81,1:07:30.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,...do you think that Henry and I are ready to take our relationship...
Dialogue: 0,1:07:30.68,1:07:32.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,...to the next level
Dialogue: 0,1:07:34.15,1:07:35.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,You sure about that?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:36.65,1:07:39.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Do you think I should bring him into the other room...
Dialogue: 0,1:07:39.55,1:07:41.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,...and take advantage of him?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:47.96,1:07:49.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,I saw that hand gesture.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:49.93,1:07:51.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- And I' m glad you did it. - Really?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:04.38,1:08:06.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- Use that. - Oh, wow. Look!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:06.51,1:08:07.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- Yeah. - They're...
Dialogue: 0,1:08:07.92,1:08:10.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,They're nodding in approval, I hope.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:10.52,1:08:12.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,They like you. Let me get them out of there.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:13.05,1:08:16.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Mary-Kate, Ashley, get a life. Thank you. Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:16.29,1:08:19.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- Oh, they're very nice, though. - Yeah, so are you.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:19.69,1:08:21.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Let me get you down slow.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:22.00,1:08:24.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- Thank you. - My pleasure.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:47.19,1:08:50.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,All right, I just wrote this, so go easy on me.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:51.59,1:08:55.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,The Hukilau was the place
Dialogue: 0,1:08:56.36,1:08:58.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Where I first saw your face
Dialogue: 0,1:09:00.94,1:09:03.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,We liked each other right away
Dialogue: 0,1:09:05.37,1:09:09.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,But you didn't remember me The very next day
Dialogue: 0,1:09:10.54,1:09:14.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Forgetful Lucy
Dialogue: 0,1:09:14.82,1:09:18.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Has got a nice caboose-y
Dialogue: 0,1:09:19.82,1:09:24.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,I used to trick you into pulling Your car over so we could chat
Dialogue: 0,1:09:24.19,1:09:28.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,But my favorite time was when you Beat the shit out of Ula with a bat
Dialogue: 0,1:09:29.10,1:09:32.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,And we drove up to see Dr. Keats
Dialogue: 0,1:09:33.07,1:09:36.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,And found out why Doug always Has to change his sheets
Dialogue: 0,1:09:38.51,1:09:42.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Forgetful Lucy
Dialogue: 0,1:09:42.21,1:09:46.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Cracked her head like Gary Busey
Dialogue: 0,1:09:46.91,1:09:49.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,But I still love her so
Dialogue: 0,1:09:51.22,1:09:54.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,And I'll never let her go
Dialogue: 0,1:09:55.69,1:09:59.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Even if while I'm singing this song
Dialogue: 0,1:10:00.23,1:10:03.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,She's wishing I had Jocko the Walus' schlong
Dialogue: 0,1:10:05.37,1:10:09.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Forgetful Lucy
Dialogue: 0,1:10:09.94,1:10:14.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Her lips are so damn juicy
Dialogue: 0,1:10:14.18,1:10:18.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,How about another first kiss
Dialogue: 0,1:10:29.19,1:10:31.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Can't fall asleep.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:31.56,1:10:33.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,I'm not sleeping.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:33.69,1:10:36.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,I'm just closing my eyes.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:36.66,1:10:38.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Well, I' m gonna go downstairs then.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:39.07,1:10:43.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,No, no. I' m just resting.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:45.37,1:10:46.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Lucy.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:47.14,1:10:48.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:48.94,1:10:50.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Will you marry me?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:58.29,1:11:01.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- Of course. - Good.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:02.19,1:11:04.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Don't forget about me.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:05.79,1:11:07.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Never.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:24.58,1:11:26.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Good morning.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:32.75,1:11:33.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, shit!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:34.16,1:11:36.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- Help! Help! - Whoa, whoa, whoa. Lucy.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:36.49,1:11:39.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Lucy! Lucy! Hey, hey, hey.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:39.49,1:11:41.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,I know this is hard for you to understand...
Dialogue: 0,1:11:41.90,1:11:44.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,...but we are actually seeing each other.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:44.40,1:11:46.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,We have been for a while now.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:46.40,1:11:47.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Oh! Lucy! Lucy! Lucy!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:47.94,1:11:50.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,If I was lying, how would I know this?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:50.27,1:11:53.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,You're an art teacher and you go to the Hukilau every Sunday...
Dialogue: 0,1:11:53.61,1:11:57.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,...and you make waffle houses and you like Casablanca lilies.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:57.34,1:12:00.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- Stalker! - No, don't you remember me a little?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:07.99,1:12:10.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,I may not be able to kick your ass, but my sister can.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:10.89,1:12:12.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Thanks, buddy.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:12.33,1:12:15.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Little Sammy Sosa's a bit shook up, but she'll be okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:15.26,1:12:17.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,She's watching the tape as we speak.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:17.26,1:12:19.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,How's my temporal lobe looking there, doc?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:19.53,1:12:22.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Don't worry. You're not gonna suffer any short-term memory loss.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:23.10,1:12:26.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,But was your head shaped like an egg before she hit you?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:26.21,1:12:29.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Don't make fun of Henry. It's not his fault it's shaped like that.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:29.71,1:12:33.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Note the intense overreaction. That's the "roids" talking.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:33.41,1:12:37.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- Doug, once again, off the juice. - It 's not juice.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:37.28,1:12:39.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,It's a protein shake.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:39.45,1:12:43.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Henry, the boys tell me you're setting sail for Alaska to study walruses.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:43.46,1:12:46.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- When does that adventure begin? - That actually began...
Dialogue: 0,1:12:46.43,1:12:50.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,...ten years ago. That's when I started planning and building my boat.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:50.63,1:12:54.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,All I know is, out of all mammals, they have the second-largest penis.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:56.20,1:12:57.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,I have the first.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:59.74,1:13:01.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,That's my joke.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:01.24,1:13:03.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Did you tell Lucy about this trip?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:03.81,1:13:05.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Well...
Dialogue: 0,1:13:05.45,1:13:09.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,...actually, there's nothing to tell because I decided not to go.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:09.48,1:13:11.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,I mean, Lucy needs me here.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:11.45,1:13:14.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,I'm just worried about going away for a year...
Dialogue: 0,1:13:14.82,1:13:17.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,...and ruining all the progress she's made.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:17.29,1:13:18.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,I know you think I' m crazy...
Dialogue: 0,1:13:18.96,1:13:20.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,...but I think deep down inside...
Dialogue: 0,1:13:20.90,1:13:24.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,...she's starting to remember me. - No, Henry.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:24.57,1:13:28.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,That's what you want to believe. It's what we all want to believe.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:28.64,1:13:30.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,But it's never gonna happen.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:34.61,1:13:36.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Okay. I gotta go to work.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:37.21,1:13:39.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Will you tell her I' II be back later to pick her up?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:39.98,1:13:43.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,See you, guys. Don't tell anyone your sister beat me up.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:43.92,1:13:47.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,He could go to the moon and back and Lucy would never even know he left.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:47.82,1:13:50.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Sometimes I wish my wife had Goldfield Syndrome.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:51.53,1:13:54.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,That way she wouldn't remember when I called her mother...
Dialogue: 0,1:13:54.66,1:13:58.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,...a loud, obnoxious drunk with a face like J. Edgar Hoover's ass.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:01.37,1:14:04.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,All right. There's your medicine, little fellow.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:05.11,1:14:07.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Ula! Get back to cleaning the pool
Dialogue: 0,1:14:07.98,1:14:12.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,If that's one of your special brownies, don't let any of the dolphins eat that.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:12.28,1:14:15.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,How do you think I get them to double flip and play with white kids?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:19.45,1:14:20.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Okay, Willie, that's it.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:20.96,1:14:23.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,This time try to stay clean for more than a day.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:23.72,1:14:25.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,I made you a nice anchovy sundae.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:26.09,1:14:27.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Okay, enjoy that.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:28.26,1:14:29.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Henry?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:30.50,1:14:32.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- Hey! - How's your head?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:32.90,1:14:36.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- Oh, it's fine. Don't worry. - Good.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:36.24,1:14:38.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,What brings your royal cuteness out here?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:38.44,1:14:39.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,I needed to see you.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:40.34,1:14:41.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Okay. What you got there?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:42.48,1:14:45.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,It's my journal I write in it every night.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:45.31,1:14:48.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- Oh, you don't like the video? - No, I love it.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:48.25,1:14:52.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,It's just sometimes when I watch it, I feel like I' m being told about my life...
Dialogue: 0,1:14:52.79,1:14:55.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,...from someone else. And when I read this...
Dialogue: 0,1:14:55.42,1:14:58.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,...it's like I' m telling myself.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:58.33,1:14:59.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,When did you start this up?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:00.33,1:15:02.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Right after you gave me the video.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:02.60,1:15:04.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- Really? - I was so nervous to come here...
Dialogue: 0,1:15:05.10,1:15:08.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,...and meet the guy that makes me fall in love with him every day.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:08.77,1:15:11.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Well, you probably thought I couldn't live up to the hype.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:12.01,1:15:15.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,No. I was nervous because...
Dialogue: 0,1:15:17.78,1:15:20.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Because I came here to break up with you.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:21.48,1:15:25.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,You had plans and a life...
Dialogue: 0,1:15:25.69,1:15:28.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,...before you met me and now all you have time for...
Dialogue: 0,1:15:28.59,1:15:30.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,...is to make me fall in love with you.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:31.13,1:15:34.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,That's not all I do. I gave a penguin a bath today.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:37.10,1:15:39.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Which I' II have to do again tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:39.20,1:15:43.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Ilook at my dad and my brother's lives and I won't do that to you.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:44.00,1:15:48.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,What do you want me to do? Be some chapter in your scrapbook and go?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:48.54,1:15:50.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,No.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:51.11,1:15:57.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,My plan is to erase you completely, so it's as if you never existed.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:59.62,1:16:01.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Why are you doing this?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:02.69,1:16:06.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Because you have to understand that there is no future with me.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:07.13,1:16:12.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Don't you want to have a career and marriage and children?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:12.40,1:16:14.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,I asked you to marry me. You said yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:14.77,1:16:16.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Kids? Yeah, I' d love to do it.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:17.67,1:16:20.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,But how is that going to work?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:20.71,1:16:24.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,I'm gonna wake up every morning with an enormous belly and no memory...
Dialogue: 0,1:16:25.15,1:16:26.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,...of how it happened?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:28.02,1:16:31.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,I have to make a new journal that doesn't have you in it.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:31.59,1:16:33.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,But before I do...
Dialogue: 0,1:16:33.55,1:16:36.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,...I really want you to read what I wrote about you.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:36.46,1:16:38.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,I will read about it tomorrow...
Dialogue: 0,1:16:38.49,1:16:41.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,...when you forget about all this breaking up stuff, okay?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:42.13,1:16:45.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,I'm not going to forget it. I wrote it down. I won't let myself.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:45.70,1:16:48.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,And I' m gonna do it whether you want me to or not.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:49.20,1:16:51.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,I'll be at my house.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:59.51,1:17:01.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Okay, type this one in there.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:02.15,1:17:03.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Saturday, November 25th.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:04.08,1:17:08.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,I drove out to Callahan Institute today and had a talk with Dr. Keats.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:09.82,1:17:11.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,There's one about me.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:11.79,1:17:15.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Reminder: He makes funny noises when I kiss his neck.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:16.96,1:17:18.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,I'm gonna miss that.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:18.70,1:17:20.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,You sure you don't want me to put that in?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:29.38,1:17:31.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- We can skip that one. - No, let me read it.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:31.75,1:17:36.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,We made love tonight! It didn't last long, but it was incredible.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:38.85,1:17:43.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,It's not all about how long you go. It 's... There was a connection, I thought.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:44.46,1:17:46.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Actually, let's just rip that out.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:08.98,1:18:11.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Well, that's that.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:19.19,1:18:21.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Henry, wait!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:27.27,1:18:30.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Could I have one last first kiss?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:42.28,1:19:45.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- I ain't gonna do this, Marlin. - You have to, Henry.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:19.15,1:20:22.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,I'm gonna miss you, but I gotta get the hell off this island.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:22.52,1:20:24.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,I'm sorry I can't take you...
Dialogue: 0,1:20:24.22,1:20:28.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,...but you've lived here so long you're too big of a pansy to defend yourself.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:29.82,1:20:33.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,I don't feel bad for you. I know you got a thing going on with Candace.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:37.43,1:20:38.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Candace and Bernice?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:41.17,1:20:43.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Candace, Bernice and Rose?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:45.24,1:20:48.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah. I fell for one chick and I' m losing my mind. Good luck with that.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:49.18,1:20:50.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Okay, baby.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:50.91,1:20:52.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Ilove you.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:52.95,1:20:55.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Thanks, buddy. Remember to use a condom.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:55.58,1:20:57.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Or in your case, a Hefty bag.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:08.20,1:21:09.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Well...
Dialogue: 0,1:21:10.00,1:21:13.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Okay, you guys. Thanks for coming to say goodbye.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:13.47,1:21:15.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Be careful
Dialogue: 0,1:21:15.34,1:21:18.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,You make sure your father doesn't get eaten by a shark.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:25.05,1:21:27.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you, buddy. What does that mean again?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:28.25,1:21:30.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Bring me back a T-shirt.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:30.22,1:21:32.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, okay. You got it.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:33.12,1:21:35.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Come here. All right. Love you guys.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:36.22,1:21:39.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,My shirt size is medium husky.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:41.36,1:21:43.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Hey! Kikikuloa!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:43.83,1:21:46.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,No flippies off the dock! You could get hurt!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:49.30,1:21:54.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,No! All right. Let the master show you how to get it done.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:02.45,1:22:06.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Now you kids go down there and find my nuts.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:06.49,1:22:08.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Sure you don't want to take Doug?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:08.49,1:22:12.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Hey! What the heck are you guys doing here?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:12.29,1:22:16.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,I spoke to the harbormaster and he said you were setting sail today...
Dialogue: 0,1:22:17.03,1:22:19.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,...so we thought we'd wish you bon voyage.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:19.53,1:22:22.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,This is from Nick and Sue. They send their best wishes.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:22.70,1:22:26.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,That's very nice. Spam and Reese's. All right.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:26.71,1:22:29.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Ilove Spam and Reese's. Can I have it?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:29.38,1:22:30.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,I guess.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:31.75,1:22:33.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- Doug! - That's all right.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:34.01,1:22:37.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- I' m sorry. - So...
Dialogue: 0,1:22:38.05,1:22:39.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,...how's Lucy?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:39.92,1:22:42.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Actually, she's living at the institute.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:43.56,1:22:46.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- When did that happen? - Three weeks ago.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:47.56,1:22:51.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Said she didn't want to be a burden to me and Doug anymore. I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:51.47,1:22:53.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,I couldn't talk her out of it. You know what?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:54.10,1:22:56.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,She's doing really great up there.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:56.47,1:22:59.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,She's teaching an art class and she gets to paint every day.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:59.87,1:23:01.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,In fact, she's even singing again.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:01.88,1:23:04.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, look, I got a little gift for you too.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:04.24,1:23:08.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,It's just a little something from one sailor to another one.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:10.15,1:23:12.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,You take care of yourself out there.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:12.25,1:23:14.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- I will. - Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:23.43,1:23:25.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Henry did not tell me about you.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:25.63,1:23:28.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Your fisherman muscles.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:28.74,1:23:30.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Can I touch?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:30.64,1:23:32.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Sure.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:37.94,1:23:39.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:47.59,1:23:48.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,The Beach Boys?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:49.22,1:23:52.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,How nice of him to give me a CD that will remind me...
Dialogue: 0,1:23:52.26,1:23:55.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,...of all the wonderful times I shared with his daughter.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:55.90,1:23:58.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,What an asshole!
Dialogue: 0,1:24:16.92,1:24:18.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, why?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:19.62,1:24:21.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Why would you do this to me?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:22.12,1:24:24.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,You sick bastard!
Dialogue: 0,1:24:29.16,1:24:30.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:31.50,1:24:33.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Is he trying to tell me something?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:38.27,1:24:40.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,She only sings on days she meets you.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:42.58,1:24:44.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,She remembers me?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:45.08,1:24:46.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Holy shit!
Dialogue: 0,1:24:47.81,1:24:50.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,She remembers me!
Dialogue: 0,1:24:55.89,1:24:57.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Julia, that looks great.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:57.76,1:25:00.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Excuse me. What am I doing?
Dialogue: 0,1:25:00.39,1:25:03.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,You're painting a picture. And you're doing an excellent job.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:03.83,1:25:05.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Oh.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:06.97,1:25:09.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Holy crap! I suck.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:18.61,1:25:20.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, hey, hey.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:20.48,1:25:23.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- Can we help you, sir? - Yes. I have an appointment.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:23.48,1:25:25.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- What's your name? - My name?
Dialogue: 0,1:25:28.62,1:25:31.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Dude, he forgot his name. I feel bad for him.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:31.99,1:25:34.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Just go on up. And good luck with that memory problem.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:35.20,1:25:37.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah. Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:39.07,1:25:40.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,What?
Dialogue: 0,1:25:40.93,1:25:43.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Lucy!
Dialogue: 0,1:25:43.60,1:25:45.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Lucy!
Dialogue: 0,1:25:45.47,1:25:48.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- Hi, I' m Tom. - Hey, I met you before. I' m Henry.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:48.24,1:25:51.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Maybe you can help me. I'm looking for Lucy Whitmore.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:51.21,1:25:52.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Any idea where I can find her?
Dialogue: 0,1:25:52.91,1:25:54.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Hi, I' m Tom.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:54.31,1:25:57.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Oh. Thanks anyways.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:57.88,1:25:59.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Lucy!
Dialogue: 0,1:26:00.69,1:26:02.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Lucy!
Dialogue: 0,1:26:06.23,1:26:07.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Lucy Whitmore...
Dialogue: 0,1:26:09.23,1:26:11.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,...can I ask you a question?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:14.17,1:26:16.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Do you have any idea who I am?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:22.44,1:26:25.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- No. - No?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:27.15,1:26:29.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,That sucks.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:30.75,1:26:33.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- What's your name? - I' m Henry.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:34.29,1:26:36.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Henry.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:37.39,1:26:40.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,I want to show you something. Will you come with me?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:40.53,1:26:41.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Well, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:43.76,1:26:45.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Hey. Do you know who that guy is?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:45.87,1:26:48.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Dude, I don't even know who I am.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:48.20,1:26:50.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, well, you're Pablo Picasso.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:50.77,1:26:54.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- Really? - No. Not really.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:57.74,1:27:00.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,This is my studio.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:19.90,1:27:22.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,I don't know who you are, Henry...
Dialogue: 0,1:27:24.10,1:27:28.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,...but I dream about you almost every night.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:30.54,1:27:32.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,1:27:32.71,1:27:36.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,What would you say if I told you that notebook you read every day...
Dialogue: 0,1:27:37.25,1:27:40.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,...used to have a lot of stuff about me in it?
Dialogue: 0,1:27:41.55,1:27:44.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,I would say that that makes a lot of sense.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:44.79,1:27:46.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,You erased me from your memories...
Dialogue: 0,1:27:46.76,1:27:49.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,...because you thought you were holding me back from having...
Dialogue: 0,1:27:50.13,1:27:51.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,...a full and happy life.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:52.33,1:27:54.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,But you made a mistake.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:55.00,1:27:58.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Being with you is the only way I could have a full and happy life.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:59.77,1:28:02.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,You're the girl of my dreams...
Dialogue: 0,1:28:02.21,1:28:05.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,...and apparently I' m the man of yours.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:10.85,1:28:12.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Henry.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:12.79,1:28:14.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,It's nice to meet you.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:14.95,1:28:17.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Lucy, it's nice to meet you too.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:22.33,1:28:24.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Hi, I' m Tom.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:24.46,1:28:26.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Henry, Lucy. Nice to meet you, Tom.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:26.80,1:28:30.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Now why don't you come back in ten seconds so we can meet again?
Dialogue: 0,1:29:15.72,1:29:19.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Do you, Honah Lee, take this woman to be your lawfully wedded wife...
Dialogue: 0,1:29:19.49,1:29:21.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,...to have and to hold from this day forh...
Dialogue: 0,1:29:22.32,1:29:24.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,...as long as you both shall live?
Dialogue: 0,1:29:24.59,1:29:26.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- I do. - Really?
Dialogue: 0,1:29:26.76,1:29:28.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Even though in, like, 10, 15 years...
Dialogue: 0,1:29:29.13,1:29:31.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,...she could possibly let herself go and then, like...
Dialogue: 0,1:29:32.00,1:29:34.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,...sex could be, like, nauseating for you?
Dialogue: 0,1:29:34.53,1:29:37.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,What are you, nuts? Your wife's right over there.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:39.31,1:29:41.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,I'm just kidding, Muumuu!
Dialogue: 0,1:29:41.34,1:29:44.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,I now pronounce you man and wife.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:49.42,1:29:51.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Mazel tov!
Dialogue: 0,1:29:53.02,1:29:55.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,It's very cold, so when you're ready...
Dialogue: 0,1:29:55.29,1:29:58.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,...put on a jacket and come have breakfast with me. Love you.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:30.99,1:30:36.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, hey! Good morning, Mrs. Roth. Would you like to meet your daughter?
Dialogue: 0,1:30:36.40,1:30:37.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Go say hello to Mommy.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:39.37,1:30:41.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Hi, Mommy.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:43.54,1:30:45.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:46.74,1:30:48.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Good morning.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:50.31,1:30:52.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, my goodness!
Dialogue: 0,1:30:53.18,1:30:55.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- Grandpa's here. - Hi, Dad.
